# Yamaha TX802 (and DX7) voice editor for the EUCLID edition of the Polyend Tracker.
# Generated by euclid-synths/tools/edisyn_dx7.py from Edisyn's YamahaDX7.java
# (https://github.com/eclab/edisyn, Apache License 2.0, Copyright Sean Luke).
# Edits the voice edit buffer with DX7 parameter changes, the TX802's extra
# voice settings (ACED) and the performance's instruments (PCED; the channel's
# Part is the instrument, 1-8), from Yamaha's TX802 SysEx tables.
synth "Yamaha TX802"
hint "Instrument group: pick each instrument's voice"
pause 50
device 1
port din
template vced F0 43 d+10 ph p v F7
template aced F0 43 d+10 18 p v F7
template pced F0 43 d+10 1A p v F7
template pcedvoice F0 43 d+10 1A p vh vl F7
request F0 43 d+20 00 F7
request F0 43 d+20 05 F7
request F0 43 d+20 7E 4C 4D 20 20 38 39 35 32 50 45 F7
parts 8 0
dump vced F0 43 d+00 00 01 1B [ data ] F7
dump aced F0 43 d+00 05 00 31 [ data ] F7
dump pced+pcedvoice hex F0 43 d+00 7E 01 68 [ 4C 4D 20 20 38 39 35 32 50 45 data ] F7
